WEBVTT

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.770
- That's my third kill.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:17.770
Give me a sonar ping.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:21.150
- On it.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.390
- I see you.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:27.460
- That was a civilian.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.580
Stop doing that! How many civilians have you killed?

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.080
Ah! They shouldn't just stand around here!

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.840
You won't get away!

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.140
Hey! Stop running!

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.450
Where'd he go?

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:53.280
Maybe another sonar ping?

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.020
No. He's probably already hiding.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.060
You guys suck.

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.810
Watch this.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.060
Wow!

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:36.130
He made it look easy.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:43.660
Just die, dumbass.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:50.810
Seriously.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.640
I can't lose at this.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:02:00.000
"Selha de no story, daite atemo ni tzuzuketa"

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.080
Like, you can talk.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.940
I did most of the work.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:45.200
No platoon player in Japan is any match for us!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:50.450
I'll have to start playing stronger opponents outside Japan or my rank won't increase.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.780
Eww, calendar.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:52.240
Hm?

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.410
Looks like someone must have heard you.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.560
We're going to accept, of course.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:04.710
Here we go! Let's reach number one!

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:12.730
Batum. The game sold over three million copies worldwide.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.870
And it doesn't use guns, only bombs.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:22.830
You use eight types of bombs, or BIMs, as the situation dictates.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:26.360
And you use sonar to find enemies while remaining out of their sight.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:30.000
That's how you win this game.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:40.640
way to go sakamoto we're keeping up with number two this kicks ass that's right we're going to

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:50.700
become number one in the world i'm 22 and i still don't have a job i sit around all day doing

00:04:50.700 --> 00:05:00.000
nothing but in the world of batum i'm stronger than anyone morris

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:08.550
than anyone and greater than anyone. I even got married. Only within the game's

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:17.690
virtual world, of course. I was content here in this wonderful place. I never

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.780
realized I was just running away there.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:46.640
Parachute? Why? I can't get down!

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:50.740
Anyone? IS ANYONE AROUND?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.370
What is this?

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:02.240
Gah!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.610
Ow.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:14.020
What is this play?

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.820
What am I doing here?

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:19.510
Did I remember anything?

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:25.570
I was just playing Batum in my room, and then...

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.120
Blood.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:35.740
What the hell's happened that I can't remember?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:45.900
Surface?

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:53.610
What the hell?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:04.790
I can feel it, but it doesn't hurt or feel weird.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:08.510
I haven't been kidnapped by a UFO or anything, have I?

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:09.330
Ha!

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:22.870
Uh, it's my bag!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:29.350
My wallet's here, and I have a change of clothes, so what, was I going somewhere overnight?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.950
What's this?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.510
Hey!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.940
Store bag!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:53.460
Boxed lunch and find out where I am.

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:27.560
so hot gotta be south somewhere better save some of this big ass bug dead meat

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:41.710
Ugh, give me a break!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:42.600
Why me?

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.030
What did I do?

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:52.400
Ugh, ah!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.620
Where am I?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:08.640
WHERE THE HELL AM I?!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.390
Mom!

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:11.830
Mom!

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.850
Damn it, Mom, I can't believe you!

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:17.740
You wrote me a resume behind my back and then sent it to the grocery store?!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.720
I WON'T WORK THERE!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:25.090
There's a job I already want, and it's not Checker.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.720
Just stay out of my business!

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:37.660
I'll go to Sotaro's.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.060
Excuse me.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.620
Huh?

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:44.610
You're Sakamoto Ryota-san, correct?

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:55.050
Parting to come back to me?

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:58.450
Someone stopped me as I was leaving.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.150
Ah!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:12.040
Jeez, just trying to remember makes my head hurt.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.770
Good thing I bought a lunch.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:20.590
What will I do tomorrow?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.910
I don't recognize this pouch.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:26.760
Not mine.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.060
Did someone put it in my bag?

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:38.110
What is this? A timer?

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.760
Well, that did something.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:50.940
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:52.130
No way.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.200
What the?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.170
What the hell was that?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.660
Those bombs?

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:12.860
What are they doing in my bag?

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:20.800
I don't want anything to do with them.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.130
CAN YOU HELP ME PLEASE?!

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:55.330
IT'S HIS PROBLEM!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.090
THIS IS JUST LIKE A GAME!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:06.660
No way. No way!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.660
I'm supposed to play Batum for real now?

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:13.850
I'm supposed to play Batum for real.

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.060
You've gotta be kidding!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.240
I can't do that!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:24.390
He's seriously trying to kill me!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:29.300
You can't run from me, you coward!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.660
Part of a tomb is hiding from the enemy.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.210
Running is how you win and-

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:48.040
No!

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.490
Ah!

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.580
He's here?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.490
How did he know my location?

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.640
Fight him.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.890
If one of these hits him, kill him for sure.

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.400
I don't have a choice!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.180
Why isn't he fighting back?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:12.260
Is he still spouting that purest crap?

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.020
Huh?

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.820
What?!

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.300
It didn't explode?!

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:22.980
The last one did!

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:28.580
Switch.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.510
It's pretty damn close.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.750
It's got a good arm.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.750
I think I need to put some distance between us.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:43.490
Oh God!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.740
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:50.070
Why would it explode now?

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:51.070
Ha ha ha!

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.810
Then Moran doesn't even know how to use his bombs.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.840
How do I use these?

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.710
There's gotta be a manual in here somewhere.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:07.240
Where did he go?

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.440
DON'T MOVE!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.570
I want answers from you!

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:14.610
Why are you attacking me?

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.440
Where are we?

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:22.400
And these smart bombs, this glass crystal on my hand.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.360
Have you ever heard of a game called Batum?

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:27.830
Huh?

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.000
Ha ha ha ha ha!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:35.110
Oh wow man, you're a dumbass. You can't remember anything.

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:39.500
You don't even know how to use a bomb, but you think you've cornered me?

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.750
Don't make me laugh.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:46.450
I won't tell you a thing before you die!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.370
Say goodnight!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:57.250
Huh? I missed again?

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.000
Why is this happening to me?

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.280
What did I do?

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:05.530
He's just a normal Japanese guy, right?

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.630
I smoked to him.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:08.820
There's no reason for him to kill me.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:10.550
There's no reason.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:14.380
I give up!

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.440
I surrender!

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.960
Please don't kill me!

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.480
He's so stupid.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.990
HEY! WHERE DID YOU GO?!

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.710
I KNOW YOU AREN'T DEAD YET!

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.530
COME ON OUT, YOU WUSS!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:44.980
No, I wanna die.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:50.260
Yes, I feel it.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.630
My snare made it.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:58.840
Beat the Batum Radar?

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:11.090
Then hiding won't help.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:13.260
Dammit! It was another miss!

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.070
Alright?

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.350
But I'm certain he's held up around here somewhere.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.640
I can feel it in my bones.

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:22.040
He has a radar, then hiding's pointless.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.690
But why won't my bombs?

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:29.050
There's a number.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.000
It's on the timer?

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.930
Dammit! Why didn't I notice it earlier?

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:37.420
In Batum, his bombs are called Crackers.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:39.920
They explode upon impact.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:42.890
Mine use timers.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:47.200
You press the switch and it explodes when the timer reaches zero.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:52.480
So it's just like Batum?

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:57.560
Calm down. Relax.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.000
From the ace of the world's number 10 team,

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.940
I can use bombs with timers.

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:19.900
Move!

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.900
Game!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.520
This is worth a game!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.360
What the hell does that do to me now?

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:39.020
HEY YOU COWARD!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:42.130
I KNOW YOU'RE HIDING IN THE CRACK BETWEEN THE ROCKS!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:45.270
He doesn't know where I am.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.580
This is my chance.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.760
Wait a minute.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.200
If he's hiding in those bushes down by the beach,

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.320
couldn't he blow me up from behind?

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:56.790
No, don't figure it out. Please let him not be that smart.

00:17:56.790 --> 00:18:00.000
Well, it doesn't matter anymore, does it?

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:06.760
If I throw bombs at both spots, I...

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:09.890
I bid you a fond farewell, coward.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:13.280
Choice.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:18.060
AHHHHH!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:24.160
Can you stay underwater forever?!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.770
When you surf as fair, I'll nail you!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.170
HAHAHAHA I'LL NAIL YOU!

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:17.740
choice. You would have killed me. It was self-defense. I didn't do anything wrong. It's not my fault.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.160
Take them to survive?

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:36.730
Game of murder, just like online.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:40.950
I have to play it in real life?

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:07.090
The sky is sparkling like a star.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:19.520
I can't help but cry because of the city's disaster.

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:26.220
Excuse me, Mr. Iida, about what you and I discussed earlier, about the firm hiring me, have you decided?

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:28.970
Oh, right. That.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.820
Would you wait here just a little longer, please?

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:36.420
The company's just so busy right now.

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:42.630
Ryota, you're playing that game again.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:45.300
God, will you quit opening my door without knocking?

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:49.980
I did knock. You didn't hear me 'cause you had those things on.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:57.950
What, Sakamoto? You're fighting with your mom again? Lame. It spoiled all the fun.

00:21:57.950 --> 00:22:00.000
Can't you see him online now? Just get out!

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:02.130
We need to talk.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:05.320
We need to discuss a job I found for you.

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.560
I spoke with a relative to see if they could do anything.

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:11.530
You remember Uncle Kazu from years ago?

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.910
We would visit him in spring.

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:17.210
He currently runs an Udon restaurant.

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:19.230
I said leave me alone.

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:22.780
Why look? I've already found the job I want.

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:26.930
You've been saying that for years. You're still unemployed.

00:22:26.930 --> 00:22:30.000
It's time to stop dreaming about working for a video game company.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:34.870
Go and find a real job in the real world!

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:39.530
Thank you, Mother. Your advice is so valuable.

00:22:39.530 --> 00:22:42.140
I'm thinking about your future here.

00:22:42.140 --> 00:22:45.840
I said get out!

00:23:03.260 --> 00:23:04.430
You're right.

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:08.310
This is the real world.

00:23:08.310 --> 00:23:09.730
I'm hungry.

00:23:09.730 --> 00:23:13.250
I come to think of it, I threw up everything I ate yesterday.

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:35.920
Yeah.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:09.940
There's a reason I ended up on this island.

00:24:09.940 --> 00:24:12.860
There's a reason I can't go back.

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:14.710
This is my punishment.

00:24:14.710 --> 00:24:17.030
My punishment for betrayal.

00:24:17.030 --> 00:24:19.880
But I still, still wish
